{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢16th Single「愛MUST BE」のMVが公開されました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんご覧いただけましたかー？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、Buddiesの皆さんと同じタイミングで観たいなと思って、0時ちょうどになるまでワクワクと待っていました🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても素敵な作品です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひこちらからチェックしてください〜\n・MUSIC VIDEO\nhttps://youtu.be/Sp4xl7wtqtc\n・Download & Streaming\nhttps://sakurazaka46.lnk.to/AiMUSTBE"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして先日、この16th Single期間をもって\n田村保乃さんが卒業されることが発表されました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "先輩とご一緒する初めてのリハの時、\nガチガチに緊張して、端っこに固まっていた四期生に笑顔で明るく「緊張するよなー」って声をかけてくださったこと。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "加入してからこれまでも、そしてきっとこれからも関わる全員に優しさを届けてくださる田村さんが大好きです。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ご一緒できる残りの時間、少しでも多くのことを学ばせていただきたいです🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "___"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "9月に突入ということで、\nこの前のミーグリは「〇〇の秋」をテーマにしてみました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobdZhNv1.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/mobB5IETF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「スポーツ(観戦)の秋」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202609/moboOhifj.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「読書、散歩？の秋」"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "皆さんはどんな秋を過ごすご予定ですか？🍂💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私は、プライベートではこの2つに加えて"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ずばり「趣味作りの秋」にしたいです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「趣味の秋」ではなく「趣味作り」。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "というのも、趣味は何?と聞いてくださっても、これといって人に紹介できるほどの趣味が思いつかず..."}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに今ハマりかけそう、興味大のものは、、\n・岩盤浴\n・美術館、博物館巡り\n・元素記号のマスコットたち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これ同じく好きだな〜とか、より沼にハマるにはまずこれおすすめなどあれば教えてください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなの趣味も教えてね👂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢ミーグリの応募が開始！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第2次応募受付は今日の14時まで🕑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "10/31ハロウィン当日もあるということで、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "👩‍⚕️か👩‍🍳か👼か😈か🏴‍☠️か...\n何かできたらな〜と考えてます💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その日以外も頑張って可愛くおめかしするのでぜひ会いにきてください！！😳🥸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お待ちしています💓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#52"}], "source": "official"}